</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00491/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一杯百█牌的可乐饮料，在被人类饮用时，对象总是会用力地摇晃瓶身，并拧开瓶盖，让饮料喷出。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.Kexin的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被Dr.Cever喝完<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>谁看到我的可乐了？——Dr.Kexin<br />
嗝—不知道……——Dr.Cever</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00491" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00491" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00491-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yangyihua" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7144335); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7144335&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608882151" alt="yangyihua" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7144335)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yangyihua" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7144335); return false;">yangyihua</a></span></p>
